amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1253bf115fdfd4a06967997eba359b3e.webm?t=1762338188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1253bf115fdfd4a06967997eba359b3e.mp4?t=1762338188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn money, you need some folks to work in the fields, and to protect them, you need guards. There are several types of folks, but not everyone is friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.poster.avif?t=1762338188\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.webm?t=1762338188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/extras/1a5d5f4934e769a5b307bd0e9cae2462.mp4?t=1762338188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Marginalact"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063810/88a718d47eae4c0b8fa4f87a8db6c28a7c79b89e/header.jpg?t=1762338188","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063810/1861273556/6151d07d7c8ddd58b4d4480f65ca024c31d01a